mx-auto px-6 pb-16 max-w-5xl\"><div class=\"rounded-[20px] text-card-foreground bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2 text-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 18H3\"></path></svg>功能亮点</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-sm text-zinc-400\"><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-white mb-2\">多平台支持</h3><p>微信公众平台、知乎、掘金、视频号、抖音、B站、小红书等主流渠道。</p></div><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-white mb-2\">智能检测</h3><p>自动检测剪贴板与当前页面，判断目标平台并提示填充。</p></div><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-white mb-2\">一键填充</h3><p>在字流编辑器完成适配后，点击插件即可一键带格式填充。</p></div><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-white mb-2\">格式适配</h3><p>自动处理标题、段落、代码块与图片链接，减少人工修正。</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"container mx-auto px-6 pb-16 max-w-5xl\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 to-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-[0_0_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] px-6 py-8 text-center relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-primary/5 pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-blue-300 mb-3\">READY</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-semibold text-white mb-4\">现在安装，立刻加速分发流程</h2><p class=\"text-base te